01:17:31.000 --> 01:17:38.000
And then you are like Parashat De-Rahim, the road bifurcates.

01:17:38.000 --> 01:17:40.000
You have to make a decision.

01:17:40.000 --> 01:17:49.000
Now, because pagan humanity did not have revelation,

01:17:49.000 --> 01:17:54.000
in a moment of crisis, they will go back into myth.

01:17:54.000 --> 01:18:02.000
And they will choose a raiz, a cosmocrater, Hitler, Napoleon, and others.

01:18:02.000 --> 01:18:14.000
Whereas, through revelation, we have the opportunity to emerge from this crisis

01:18:14.000 --> 01:18:19.000
without having to go back into imagination.

01:18:19.000 --> 01:18:22.000
For my manners, my interpretation is correct.

01:18:22.000 --> 01:18:36.000
The danger of Aristotle is the unawareness of the boundaries of rationality.

01:18:36.000 --> 01:18:47.000
And therefore, when there is a crisis, the danger of going back to a political kind of cosmocrater.

01:18:47.000 --> 01:18:49.000
That's more or less.

01:18:49.000 --> 01:18:54.000
So my manners, I started up to a point.

01:18:54.000 --> 01:18:57.000
